WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.957
Unit eleven. Sugary Drinks!

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.422
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.472 --> 00:00:10.240
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:13.336
Today we learn about Sugary Drinks. Let's go!

5
00:00:14.307 --> 00:00:17.407
Sugar. Say it with me. Sugar!

6
00:00:20.977 --> 00:00:24.144
Soda. Say it with me. Soda!

7
00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:31.026
Juice. Say it with me. Juice!

8
00:00:34.512 --> 00:00:37.295
Teeth. Say it with me. Teeth!

9
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.566
Weight. Say it with me. Weight!

10
00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:50.699
Diabetes. Say it with me. Diabetes!

11
00:00:54.186 --> 00:00:57.419
Water. Say it with me. Water!

12
00:01:00.922 --> 00:01:04.055
Label. Say it with me. Label!

13
00:01:07.563 --> 00:01:17.018
Soda and many juice drinks contain lots of sugar. Too much sugar harms teeth and can lead to weight gain and diabetes. Checking the label and choosing water are healthy habits.

14
00:01:17.068 --> 00:01:19.776
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:21.149 --> 00:01:26.275
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:26.325 --> 00:01:27.300
Juice!

17
00:01:28.005 --> 00:01:33.258
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:33.308 --> 00:01:34.458
Water!

19
00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:42.306
Did you know? The WHO recommends keeping free sugars to less than 10% of daily energy — and ideally below 5%!

20
00:01:42.356 --> 00:01:44.594
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.848 --> 00:01:53.374
Think and answer. How much sugar is in your favourite drink?

22
00:01:53.424 --> 00:01:54.574
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.649 --> 00:02:00.216
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.266 --> 00:02:02.829
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

